<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Telefonica del Peru.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Telefonica del Peru.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Telefonica del Peru SA to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;In our opinion, the recent market weakness caused by the terrorist activity in Peru reresents an excellent buying opportunity for investors,&quot; analyst Luiz Carvalho said in a report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;This upgrade is based on our view that Peru's economic fundamentals will not be seriously affected by the current crisis and that the outlook for Telefonica del Peru remains positive,&quot; the analyst said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 18-5/8 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
